# Keep the build context small and never ship local state or secrets.

# --- JavaScript -------------------------------------------------------------
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo

# --- PHP --------------------------------------------------------------------
# vendor/ is installed inside the image from composer.lock, so a host copy
# would both bloat the context and risk shipping platform-wrong binaries.
apps/api/vendor
apps/api/storage/logs/*
apps/api/storage/framework/cache/*
apps/api/storage/framework/sessions/*
apps/api/storage/framework/views/*
apps/api/storage/phpstan
apps/api/bootstrap/cache/*
apps/api/.phpunit.result.cache
apps/api/.phpunit.cache

# --- Tests and tooling output ----------------------------------------------
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.log

# --- Secrets ----------------------------------------------------------------
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/auth.json

# --- Repository metadata ----------------------------------------------------
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
docs
infra/.data
infra/backups

# Documentation is not needed at build time, except the architectural contract
# which is useful when inspecting an image.
**/*.md
!CLAUDE.md
